    "moka_faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "moka_faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will my baby take it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Every baby is different, which is why Moka is covered by a 90-day guarantee. Try it through real feeds and send it back if it is not right.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "I already found a bottle that works. Why switch?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>You do not have to switch everything at once. Start with one bottle if you want glass milk contact, fewer parts, and a cleaner routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Does it work for the bottle-resistant?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Moka uses a wide, 15° naturally-shaped nipple to support a deeper latch, but no bottle can guarantee acceptance for every baby.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it really Swiss-engineered?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Moka is Swiss-engineered with a bottom vent, five laser-cut flow stages, and material choices designed around everyday feeding.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What's the nipple made of?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Platinum-cured silicone, chosen for softness, heat stability, and longer-lasting daily use than ordinary food-grade silicone.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it really lead-free?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Independent third-party testing confirmed Moka is lead-free.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How should I clean it to make it last?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Boil, steam, or UV when you need to. For longest life, hand-wash the silicone and PPSU parts and sterilize occasionally rather than every time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_8": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How do I know which flow my baby needs?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Start by age, then watch the feed. Gulping or pulling off means slow it down; frustration or chewing means speed it up.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_9": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will it fit my pump?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Pump compatibility depends on the pump and adapter. Please confirm compatibility for your specific pump before use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_10": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Does this prevent colic?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No bottle can prevent or cure colic. Moka is designed to help reduce swallowed air by keeping air out of the milk.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_11": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What is included?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Each bottle includes the bottle, nipple, collar, cap, and sealing disc. Replacement nipples are sold separately.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_12": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What's the guarantee?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Use Moka for 90 days through real feeds, washes, and nights. If it is not right for your baby, send it back for a refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
